check 1
# Census: client messages and server replies (sim/intents-events.md §2-§3,
# §9, seams/messages.md): walk, run, walk to a unit, run to a unit, skill
# selection, a right skill into nothing, the stop (0x1E-style) messages of the
# first dispatcher group, the stat/skill point messages, all in one run.
# Packets channel (the full C->S and S->C streams), plus state.
name sys-intents-moves
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion --level 12 --stat 4=3 --stat 5=2
seed 1234
ticks 140
seconds 300
channels packets state
at 6 send Walk x=@x+6 y=@y
at 20 send Run x=@x y=@y+5
at 36 send Walk x=@x-3 y=@y-3
at 50 send SelectSkill skill=36 left=0 item=0xFFFFFFFF
at 56 send RightSkill x=@x+4 y=@y+4
at 70 send AddStatPoint stat=2 repeat=1
at 76 send Run x=@x+8 y=@y
at 100 send WalkToUnit type=1 id=@1:148
